      "effect_text": {
        "en": {
          "plain": "This card is treated as \"Hyper Energy\".\n[Cn/Turn] Put four cards from the top of your deck into your gauge, choose up to one card in your hand or drop zone, and you may [Transform], [Impact Transform], [Ride], or [Station] into the chosen card by paying its cost. Then, choose and use one of the following three.\n• If you are [Transform] into a card, for this turn, change the defense of a card on your opponent's field to 0.\n• If you are [Ride] into a card, draw a card, and you gain 2 life!\n• If you are [Station] into a card, during the attack phase of this turn and the next turn, you may call a《Crew Trooper》from the soul of your items by paying its [Call Cost].",
